  "body_html": "<p>Before we begin, please note, I do <strong>NOT</strong> consider myself a “day trader”. It is something I do on occasion; and never for more than a few weeks. It is an exhausting and time intensive work load for just a few minutes to few hours of price action. Regardless, I occasionally get the itch and have developed a strategy and routine that is profitable <em><strong>over time</strong></em>. Is it the best strategy in the world? Unlikely. But it works well for me…you may have a different schedule, different tolerances, different capital…so feel free to tailor to YOUR personal approach. </p><p>October 2024 was the last “period” I day traded, and netted over $30k just day trading Paypal <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$PYPL&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> .  Below are the simple rules I followed 👇</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yN-W!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F01bc7412-023c-4dcb-99fe-4878a9c583da_458x93.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yN-W!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F01bc7412-023c-4dcb-99fe-4878a9c583da_458x93.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yN-W!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F01bc7412-023c-4dcb-99fe-4878a9c583da_458x93.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yN-W!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F01bc7412-023c-4dcb-99fe-4878a9c583da_458x93.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yN-W!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F01bc7412-023c-4dcb-99fe-4878a9c583da_458x93.jpeg\" width=\"458\" height=\"93\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/01bc7412-023c-4dcb-99fe-4878a9c583da_458x93.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:93,&quot;width&quot;:458,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:10591,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/164802056?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F01bc7412-023c-4dcb-99fe-4878a9c583da_458x93.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yN-W!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F01bc7412-023c-4dcb-99fe-4878a9c583da_458x93.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yN-W!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F01bc7412-023c-4dcb-99fe-4878a9c583da_458x93.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yN-W!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F01bc7412-023c-4dcb-99fe-4878a9c583da_458x93.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!yN-W!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F01bc7412-023c-4dcb-99fe-4878a9c583da_458x93.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><p></p><p>As mentioned…day trading is an immense amount of work. Not everyday will be a winner. You will have periods where trades go in your favor and days they do not. The primary point is to either: </p><ol><li><p>Win more often than you lose and/or:</p></li><li><p>Win significantly larger by % than you lose by %. </p><ol><li><p>As an example, you have 10 trades. 7 you “lose” but only by a small percentage, but your 3 wins are massive. Peter Lynch only bats ~38% accuracy, but his wins are enormous.</p><p></p></li></ol></li></ol><p>Make sure you customize this to YOUR life. I don’t day trade everyday because I have 2 kids that demand pancakes in the morning. Truth be told, I’m a glorified IHOP griddle chef in the morning for them 🤣. We have beaten risk management enough, I will spare you…this time… and get strait to the strategy.  </p><h4>Rule 1: Catalyst - InverseNews</h4><p>Stocks do not move very much, up or down, without some form of catalyst behind them. Earnings are the most common (which for me personally, I avoid, too unpredictable). The easiest in my opinion, is to inverse the news. There was a reason I was “InverseNews” before “EconomyAndStocks” on TikTok…its because in the short term, the news is most often wrong. Jim Cramer is famous for being consistently incorrect. So use that to your advantage. </p><p>Now that is not to say, you buy as soon as you see a negative article. You want both. Tons of articles were coming out about PayPal at the time, <em><strong>both positive and negative. This is the BEST. </strong></em>“Stocks love to climb a mountain of fear.” By having both positive and negative news, you get an asset that is bouncing at dips, trending upwards. Keep it simple: <strong>you want lots of mixed news. </strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydvF!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F99209f07-b539-42b5-88e3-e62d8a921480_667x163.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydvF!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F99209f07-b539-42b5-88e3-e62d8a921480_667x163.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydvF!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F99209f07-b539-42b5-88e3-e62d8a921480_667x163.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydvF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F99209f07-b539-42b5-88e3-e62d8a921480_667x163.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydvF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F99209f07-b539-42b5-88e3-e62d8a921480_667x163.png\" width=\"667\" height=\"163\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/99209f07-b539-42b5-88e3-e62d8a921480_667x163.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:163,&quot;width&quot;:667,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:38325,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/164802056?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F99209f07-b539-42b5-88e3-e62d8a921480_667x163.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydvF!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F99209f07-b539-42b5-88e3-e62d8a921480_667x163.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydvF!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F99209f07-b539-42b5-88e3-e62d8a921480_667x163.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydvF!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F99209f07-b539-42b5-88e3-e62d8a921480_667x163.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydvF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F99209f07-b539-42b5-88e3-e62d8a921480_667x163.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Negative Article. Seek words like “struggling” “down” “sell” etc.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wfgA!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc7b7d3c-b186-41d9-90e3-64febc002147_692x169.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wfgA!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc7b7d3c-b186-41d9-90e3-64febc002147_692x169.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wfgA!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc7b7d3c-b186-41d9-90e3-64febc002147_692x169.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wfgA!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc7b7d3c-b186-41d9-90e3-64febc002147_692x169.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wfgA!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc7b7d3c-b186-41d9-90e3-64febc002147_692x169.png\" width=\"692\" height=\"169\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/cc7b7d3c-b186-41d9-90e3-64febc002147_692x169.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:169,&quot;width&quot;:692,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:32226,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/164802056?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc7b7d3c-b186-41d9-90e3-64febc002147_692x169.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wfgA!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc7b7d3c-b186-41d9-90e3-64febc002147_692x169.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wfgA!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc7b7d3c-b186-41d9-90e3-64febc002147_692x169.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wfgA!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc7b7d3c-b186-41d9-90e3-64febc002147_692x169.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wfgA!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc7b7d3c-b186-41d9-90e3-64febc002147_692x169.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Positive Article. Paypal is innovating here. </figcaption></figure></div><h4>Rule 2: Pre-Market Gap Up</h4><p>When you are sleeping at night, someone…or something…is always monitoring what is happening. They are buying or selling with information and data you are unaware of at the time. That price action alone, tells you that something is going on. You may not know “what”…but something is happening. My <em><strong>2nd rule is that there must be a gap up during pre-market (or gap down if shorting). </strong></em>Unfortunately I cannot pull up the 5 minute chart for PayPal back in October 2024…but we recently traded Rigetti for ~12% profit. A gap up pre-market most often precedes a large run for the day. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_tE8!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ea4b5d-2407-47db-8f68-8d7e016d4f15_1339x779.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_tE8!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ea4b5d-2407-47db-8f68-8d7e016d4f15_1339x779.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_tE8!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ea4b5d-2407-47db-8f68-8d7e016d4f15_1339x779.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_tE8!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ea4b5d-2407-47db-8f68-8d7e016d4f15_1339x779.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_tE8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ea4b5d-2407-47db-8f68-8d7e016d4f15_1339x779.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_tE8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ea4b5d-2407-47db-8f68-8d7e016d4f15_1339x779.png\" width=\"1339\" height=\"779\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d5ea4b5d-2407-47db-8f68-8d7e016d4f15_1339x779.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:779,&quot;width&quot;:1339,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:139239,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/164802056?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ea4b5d-2407-47db-8f68-8d7e016d4f15_1339x779.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_tE8!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ea4b5d-2407-47db-8f68-8d7e016d4f15_1339x779.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_tE8!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ea4b5d-2407-47db-8f68-8d7e016d4f15_1339x779.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_tE8!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ea4b5d-2407-47db-8f68-8d7e016d4f15_1339x779.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_tE8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd5ea4b5d-2407-47db-8f68-8d7e016d4f15_1339x779.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p> Ensure you have “extended hours” turned on for your charts. An easy way to spot potential candidates is to just see what is green in your ticker pane’s extended hours column. Or red if shorting.</p><p><em>To continue reading the last 3 rules, consider subscribing 👋 </em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a> </strong></em></p><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
  "truncated_body_text": "Before we begin, please note, I do NOT consider myself a “day trader”. It is something I do on occasion; and never for more than a few weeks. It is an exhausting and time intensive work load for just a few minutes to few hours of price action. Regardless, I occasionally get the itch and have developed a strategy and routine that is profitable",
